# Ignore all font directories except those committed to the repo.
# Fonts like NotoSansCJK are downloaded on demand by build-sd-fonts.py.
*
!.gitignore
!NotoSerif/
!NotoSerif/**
!NotoSans/
!NotoSans/**
!NotoSansArabic/
!NotoSansArabic/**
!NotoSansHebrew/
!NotoSansHebrew/**
!OpenDyslexic/
!OpenDyslexic/**
!Ubuntu/
!Ubuntu/**
# Libre Franklin ships as a variable font upstream; these are the wght 400 and
# 700 instances cut by build-sd-fonts.py, committed as statics so
# convert-builtin-fonts.sh reproduces the UI headers without a network fetch.
!LibreFranklin/
!LibreFranklin/**
